  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/lasantosr/intelli-shell/tarball/v3.4.6",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/lasantosr/intelli-shell/zipball/v3.4.6",
  "body": "This release introduces customizable shell integration hotkeys and list navigation shortcuts, alongside important fixes for inline terminal resizing, search filtering, and process execution lifecycle management.\r\n\r\n### Features\r\n\r\n- **Configurable Shell Hotkeys**: You can now customize shell integration shortcuts via a dedicated `[hotkeys]` section in your configuration file. Keybindings for searching, bookmarking, variable management, and AI fix are dynamically templated across Bash, Zsh, Fish, Nushell, and PowerShell.\r\n- **Configurable List Navigation**: Keybindings for list traversal (`list_up`, `list_down`, `page_up`, `page_down`) are now fully configurable, allowing you to tailor list navigation to your preferred modal or arrow-less key layouts.\r\n\r\n### Improvements\r\n\r\n- **Reliable Process Cancellation**: Long-running or detached commands that redirect standard streams (such as `/dev/null`) now respond immediately to cancellation signals, preventing terminal hangs when canceling tasks.\r\n- **Resilient TLDR Synchronization**: The `tldr` cache update mechanism now automatically recovers and tracks remote branches if the local repository enters a detached or missing branch state.\r\n- **Compound Command Safety**: Destructive command detection now properly recognizes `&` background delimiters, ensuring dangerous operations inside background statements are flagged correctly.\r\n- **Preserved JSON Import Metadata**: Importing bookmarks from JSON files now reliably retains and persists all associated tags and filters.\r\n\r\n### Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- **Inline Viewport Resizing**: Resizing terminal windows while running in inline mode now properly recalculates rendering boundaries, preventing the TUI from clipping or being pushed off-screen.\r\n- **Filtered Alias Searches**: The fast-path alias search now respects active category, tag, and source filters instead of returning unfiltered exact matches.\r\n- **Fuzzy Search Parser Stability**: Fixed search input parsing to ignore unclosed or incomplete exact match markers while typing, preventing erratic empty result lists.\r\n\r\n### Update Considerations\r\n\r\n- **Shell Reload Required**: Because shell integration scripts now dynamically template configured hotkeys, you must restart your active terminal sessions or re-source your shell configuration files after upgrading.",
